rf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025, February to March ran 26% of normal and June to July ran 180% on the middle of the grids. All 8 grids had their driest year in 1956, and grid 19929 got 43% of normal that year.</p>"}
